{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "de76be6cd4dcc18e0656f84f18f2b30a09d8b2b5a1976f39909384ea2191ea7b", "ja": "あっ、やっぱり届いてた！　前に劇場のみんなが\n出演したホラー映画、『魅裏怨』のDVD！", "zh": "啊，果然已经送来了！之前剧场的大家\n参与演出的恐怖电影──《魅里怨》的DVD！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "99108eb02df87f147c8542eab4daf51fa5a6e913862a8934cc7028a455c492b5", "ja": "でも、これをひとりで観るのは……\nさすがに、怖いかもしれない……よね……？", "zh": "可是一个人看这部片……\n实在有点恐怖……吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3d21fbab5196ed8653fc2842ae133b27031007f5d8e7615f033840665a3dc234", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\nやっぱり9月はまだまだ暑いですね。", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n果然到了九月还是很炎热呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "ef474601cfc96f88d9b2db5ba223ccbfa0ce0727483abda8e617a62ec5c48523", "ja": "きゃあっ！？\nあっ……{$P$}さん？", "zh": "呀啊！？\n啊……{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "982abf8c0e7dabb1c3c21064f40a3f180a6c70cdc8f472f213a329f85dd800b0", "ja": "な、なんだか驚かせてしまったみたいですみません。\nあれ、そこにあるのは、もしかして……。", "zh": "我、我好像吓到你了，不好意思。\n咦，放在那里的该不会是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "c3f5d03f1d3877cd8978b5704830eef4a72b80fafc5a9ba5f320aeafab9f5103", "ja": "はい、『魅裏怨』のDVDです！\n今日ちょうど届いたみたいで。", "zh": "是的，是《魅里怨》的DVD！\n正好今天送到的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2a42782902705fbf2e18c9f61d9670f909cfbac5b36359bc80ccce52da7eb63e", "ja": "ちょうどよかった。DVD発売に合わせて、リリース\n記念イベントをやるので、見直したかったんです。", "zh": "来得正好，为了配合DVD发售，\n之后要举行发片纪念活动，所以我正想要重看一次呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "1b05d830e610b785424e3a092f6df122a93c16d37ccbaf512c9085d84526dc8a", "ja": "そうなんですか？　えへへ、実は私も、\nちょっと見てみたいな～なんて思ったんですけど……。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n嘿嘿，其实我刚刚也正打算要看呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_1008", "source_sha256": "d095b71eb7c5a815c8f40492f2a9671caf3b96187cb1d4ff1c425f70f72f1089", "ja": "みんなで観ましょう！", "zh": "大家一起看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "32faa5d636fa1d6ea97eb7741e4e5153939eb12c107224e07642ba8281a273cb", "ja": "だったら、みんなで鑑賞会をしませんか？\nせっかくですし、社長や音無さんも呼んで……。", "zh": "既然如此，要不要找大家一起来开个鉴赏会呢？\n难得有这个机会，把社长和音无小姐也叫来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2001_102mis", "source_sha256": "02ec87eef7434e833e66eedf878a953f76d037fb66a297431e7c4b955acb9bbd", "ja": "わあ、いいんですか？", "zh": "哇，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2002_102mis", "source_sha256": "6c60fe65bc43bb1989f4a8b4a14b19e13272065d34f8a8a2cf1e3b22c5f29024", "ja": "さっそく、社長さんと音無先輩に連絡してみますね！\nお仕事、忙しくないといいんですけど……。", "zh": "那我立刻联络社长和音无前辈！\n希望他们没有在忙工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2003_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2004_101kot", "source_sha256": "239f67d64a5059ca7add844790dad722a5bdac65ec01a30c6ca15c9834d4e8a5", "ja": "こんばんは。うふふ、お呼ばれしてきちゃいました♪\nおいしいお煎餅を買ってきたので、よかったら。", "zh": "晚安，呵呵，承蒙邀请所以我就跑来啰♪\n我还买了美味的煎饼带来，不嫌弃的话请用吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2005_president", "source_sha256": "0d0e6a86b195797a122abb43ac719e55f16005ff8ccca4711b27a9beabbb3a74", "ja": "私からは、きんつばだよ。ここのは絶品なんだ。\n映画のおともにしてくれたまえ！", "zh": "我带来的是金锷烧喔，这家店的金锷烧可是极品啊。\n就当作是配电影的零食吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2006_102mis", "source_sha256": "670deb23491ebac1a0cc77b53a6a6779272ce98b84a521304408bc4a59572aa3", "ja": "わあ、ありがとうございます！　とっても美味しそう♪\nさっそく、冷たいお茶を淹れてきますね。", "zh": "哇，谢谢两位！看起来非常好吃呢♪\n我马上去泡些冰凉的茶过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2007_p", "source_sha256": "e9daea6b59b943eddc4dfc1d2c669b11fafd60994d3a3ccb607d8cc6f9fa45fb", "ja": "急な誘いだったのに、差し入れまで……\nありがとうございます。", "zh": "临时起意邀两位过来，竟然还带了慰劳品……\n真的很感谢你们这么周到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2008_president", "source_sha256": "24f82d4d8e815708de0770d945c64a4e9b8e2e33ff6cb2a47a8471e713b09668", "ja": "いやぁ、なに。いつもはこっちの事務所に\n呼び出してばかりだからね！　それより……。", "zh": "哎呀，这没什么，毕竟平常都是我找你来事务所嘛！\n先不说这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2009_president", "source_sha256": "f77fa8727bcb24014ae110f08d33a3aacb1d908c8f834af3e0982bcdb741eb3d", "ja": "DVD発売イベント前に、予習の会までするなんて。\n仕事熱心で、実に素晴らしいじゃないかね、君！", "zh": "竟然还在DVD发售活动前做预习，\n你真的是对工作充满热忱，实在太出色了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2010_101kot", "source_sha256": "94e3335873ef826b2bb5d709cd5f8364946a183967412f6f2a5b214b9b4612ec", "ja": "社長、予習といっても、今日はあくまでアイドルの\nみんなが出演した映画を楽しむのがメインですからね。", "zh": "社长，虽然说是预习，\n但今天的主题可是好好享受偶像们演出的电影喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2011_president", "source_sha256": "cba9e6ee99e5b9de253b70db54e6e4ce2e5c2ed5b0c23bf28b9bcd234c1ec13f", "ja": "おっと、そうだった。音無君は、この作品がDVDに\nなるのを、ずいぶん楽しみにしていたんだったね！", "zh": "哎呀，的确是如此呢。\n关于这部作品的DVD啊，音无可是期待了很久呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2012_president", "source_sha256": "ce164c0e627a0e72dcd5abdbf71d006f5199b6357ccfe34ae45169ed29409f4b", "ja": "連絡をもらった後、そわそわしながら\nパソコンをいじっていたからね。", "zh": "在接到联络后，\n她在电脑前就一直坐立难安呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2013_101kot", "source_sha256": "c69ace858d628d0c305ffe4d1c87f6f3e5818dc16a71b85e18c7f5978dd2e6dc", "ja": "それは、おもたせのお菓子を探していたんです。\nせっかくの鑑賞会ですからね！", "zh": "那只是在找要带来的点心而已，\n毕竟是难得的鉴赏会呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2014_p", "source_sha256": "ceb2f96c559ac664f45d199f654b72efdddbf09dc6bfe9e79445d0ae2c45a579", "ja": "なるほど！　……うん、本当だ。\n音無さん、このお煎餅とてもおいしいですよ！", "zh": "原来如此！嗯……真的耶。\n音无小姐，这个煎饼非常好吃喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2015_102mis", "source_sha256": "55af693285bddf93c31be8d0eaeaa0e33f2b955de290bf45ad3771f3be72a890", "ja": "お茶、お待たせしました。……？　なんだか\n盛り上がってますけど、映画のことですか？", "zh": "茶泡好了，让你们久等了……嗯？\n气氛好像很热络，是在讨论电影的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2016_president", "source_sha256": "2f1e0cb2755acba038f46003a7f681efc3f2013f4fb4de892a3b1374a607bdab", "ja": "うむ！　出演は……矢吹可奈君、北上麗花君、佐竹\n美奈子君、篠宮可憐君、真壁瑞希君の5人だったね。", "zh": "嗯！参与演出的是……矢吹可奈、北上丽花、\n佐竹美奈子、筿宫可怜、真壁瑞希这五人对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2017_p", "source_sha256": "ce00d0062f0ff8e89b22b0d81745d206cf3f080be7869ec41c25901a606c5cc4", "ja": "はい。ホラーの演技ということで、悩んだところも\nあったみたいですが……みんな頑張ってくれました！", "zh": "是的。由于要求的是恐怖片的演技，\n所以她们似乎也有些烦恼……不过大家都非常努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2018_101kot", "source_sha256": "f1fa446910ef410853dab51dfe0defda2d38c97ec7c3220cbb0400a8a2db71f8", "ja": "主題歌も、とっても素敵ですよね。ホラーらしい\n冷たい怖さの中に、どこか熱さもあって……。", "zh": "主题曲也非常棒呢。\n在带有恐怖片风格的颤栗中，蕴藏着一股热情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2019_p", "source_sha256": "dc155f48ccd5e362c9a7076a45303aa0bfb53a2bbe40369455be996189ac87c4", "ja": "はい。作品にも合っていると思いますし……\nあ、お茶、全員に行き渡りましたね。", "zh": "是啊，我认为也很契合这部作品……\n啊，大家都拿到茶了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2020_102mis", "source_sha256": "6809b6600b0f08ecbd2e71e0829910ef907205f68685dad444daf37089419ca1", "ja": "お代わり、いつでもどうぞ♪", "zh": "随时都可以续杯喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2021_101kot", "source_sha256": "08db6743f6739dda99930497efcf830422dfa94e829282caf0a9969bf45cd6f2", "ja": "お菓子の準備も万端です。\nそれじゃあ……。", "zh": "点心也准备妥当了，\n那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2022_president", "source_sha256": "2b72dc2ac7147ef7ec92e465027a9ebdecc345674925215467d859e8c0a0c5fc", "ja": "うむ。そろそろ上映開始といこうか。\n君、始めてくれたまえ！", "zh": "嗯，差不多该开始放映了。\n你可以开播啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2023_p", "source_sha256": "3cf32cabb60b0cce6858ef381b0ca53aa4d3cc8a0a181591e1c126e03f19a540", "ja": "はい！\nでは、再生……と。", "zh": "好的！\n那我就按下播放键了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0100_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_intro_2024_se", "source_sha256": "9cb42a0f1e83f88d6fe62ae05334a2f18e6ce7c1ce7b5e45352cd35560c8cd9f", "ja": "ウィーン……", "zh": "唰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
